<title>FRANCE: French economy grew 1.3 percent in 1996 -Arthuis.</title>
<headline>French economy grew 1.3 percent in 1996 -Arthuis.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>French finance minister Jean Arthuis said on Wednesday that economic growth in 1996 would be around 1.3 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;The people in our economic statistics office tell me the most realistic hypothesis is for 1.3-percent GDP growth&quot; (for 1996), he told a news conference.</p>
</text>
